{
  "913301": {
    "Id": 913301,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "哈啊……唔……\n不好意思，昨晚熬夜打游戏了。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "006",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv1_001",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "913302": {
    "Id": 913302,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "好麻烦，为什么我要一直守在这里……",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "005",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv1_002",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "913303": {
    "Id": 913303,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "嗯？你刚刚跟我说话了？我还以为是做梦呢……",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "002",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv1_003",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "913304": {
    "Id": 913304,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "想买东西的话就随便拿吧，记得付款。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv1_004",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "913305": {
    "Id": 913305,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "只要你愿意，星塔里的东西你想拿多少就能拿多少。但对于你们旅人来说，这真的是好事吗……呵呵。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv1_005",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "913306": {
    "Id": 913306,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "困死了，我要睡一会儿……你请便吧。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "006",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv2_001",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "913307": {
    "Id": 913307,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "嘘，小点声，要是让店长看到我在和顾客闲聊，会扣工资的。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "005",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv2_002",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "913308": {
    "Id": 913308,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "你看起来状态不错，比我还有精神，我看你更适合在星塔里打工。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv2_003",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "913309": {
    "Id": 913309,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "想向我寻求建议？可我只是个便利店店员啊。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv2_004",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "913310": {
    "Id": 913310,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "说起来，你会打游戏？那就陪我来一局吧。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "002",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv2_005",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "913311": {
    "Id": 913311,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "欢迎光临……今天进了些新货……有你想要的吗？",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv3_001",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "913312": {
    "Id": 913312,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "你说那只企鹅？它是我的店长。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv3_002",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "913313": {
    "Id": 913313,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "要结账的话，把辉光币放桌上就好。\n我先把这局游戏打完了再说。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "002",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv3_003",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "913314": {
    "Id": 913314,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "尽可能买点有用的东西，我可不想下次看到你鼻青脸肿地进来。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv3_004",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "913315": {
    "Id": 913315,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "我一直觉得努力也没什么用。\n不过……如果遇到了危险，还请努力活下去。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_event_lv3_005",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "913316": {
    "Id": 913316,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "还有什么事吗？\n没有的话，就谢谢惠顾了。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv1_001",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "913317": {
    "Id": 913317,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "期待您再次光临。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv1_002",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "913318": {
    "Id": 913318,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "抱歉，我这里不赊账。\n如果辉光币不够了，自己想办法再攒点吧。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv1_003",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "913319": {
    "Id": 913319,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "还想再看看吗？想看多久都行。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv1_004",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "913320": {
    "Id": 913320,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "看得差不多就行了，一会儿还会再见的。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "002",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv1_005",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "913321": {
    "Id": 913321,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "我这里只卖这些东西，没有什么隐藏道具。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv2_001",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "913322": {
    "Id": 913322,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "你对店长感兴趣？店长心情好的时候就会和你说话，如果不理你......那就是心情不好。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv2_002",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "913323": {
    "Id": 913323,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "跟我多说说星塔外的事吧，我会感谢你的。\n打折？这我可做不了主……",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv2_003",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "913324": {
    "Id": 913324,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "你们旅人究竟是为了什么才来攀登星塔？\n就那么想要神器吗？",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "002",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv2_004",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "913325": {
    "Id": 913325,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "谢谢惠顾。\n唉，没人和我说话的时候，倒是还能数数这些辉光币打发时间……",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv2_005",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "913326": {
    "Id": 913326,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "我可以陪你再聊会儿，就当是给老顾客的特别回馈了。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv3_001",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "913327": {
    "Id": 913327,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "如果这些东西能帮到你，我也算没白忙活。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "002",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv3_002",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "913328": {
    "Id": 913328,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "满意的话下次再来哦，要是见不到你，我会感到很无聊的。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv3_003",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "913329": {
    "Id": 913329,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "如果累了的话，在这里休息一会也不是不行。\n要喝点什么吗？",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "002",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv3_004",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "913330": {
    "Id": 913330,
    "Name": "波西亚",
    "Content": "有时候也想去星塔外看看……呵呵，还是别做白日梦了。",
    "Color": "#4fad86",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc133_chat_lv3_005",
    "NPCId": 9133,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "917201": {
    "Id": 917201,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "哪里受伤了，让我看看。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv1_001",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "917202": {
    "Id": 917202,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "不需要治疗的话就快走。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "006",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv1_002",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "917203": {
    "Id": 917203,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "已经不行了？那就出去歇着吧。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "008",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv1_003",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "917204": {
    "Id": 917204,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "感觉在哪里见过我？那只是你的错觉。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "011",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv1_004",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "917205": {
    "Id": 917205,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "想被扎一针？行啊。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "009",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv1_005",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "917206": {
    "Id": 917206,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "别浪费时间，赶紧治好赶紧走。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv2_001",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "917207": {
    "Id": 917207,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "轻伤不下火线，继续前进吧。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "008",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv2_002",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "917208": {
    "Id": 917208,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "不错，还活着。这次需要扎几针？",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "009",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv2_003",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "917209": {
    "Id": 917209,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "我只会在这里治疗旅人，你在其他地方见到的……是别人。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv2_004",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "917210": {
    "Id": 917210,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "我从没见过有人像你这样，缠着要我扎针的。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "012",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv2_005",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "917211": {
    "Id": 917211,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "我不是来专程照顾你的……说吧，伤哪了？",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv3_001",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "917212": {
    "Id": 917212,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "下次多注意一些，别再给我添麻烦了。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "011",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv3_002",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "917213": {
    "Id": 917213,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "不错，表现比我预想的要好。来吧，给你做个检查。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "008",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv3_003",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "917214": {
    "Id": 917214,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "什么直播？你是伤到脑子了吗？",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "013",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv3_004",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "917215": {
    "Id": 917215,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "好好好，给你来一针，别着急。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "009",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_event_lv3_005",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      10700,
      999999
    ]
  },
  "917216": {
    "Id": 917216,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "赶紧走吧，别在这里碍手碍脚的。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "013",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_chat_lv1_001",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "917217": {
    "Id": 917217,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "我这里不收留伤患，请回吧。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "003",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_chat_lv1_002",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "917218": {
    "Id": 917218,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "勉强是没有意义的，坚持不下去就算了，回头不丢人。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "010",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_chat_lv1_003",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "917219": {
    "Id": 917219,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "怎么？被扎上瘾了？",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "006",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_chat_lv1_004",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "917220": {
    "Id": 917220,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "受伤不奇怪，但你很脆弱也是真的。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "012",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_chat_lv1_005",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      0,
      2699
    ]
  },
  "917221": {
    "Id": 917221,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "刚才的惨叫是装的吗？那你演技不错啊。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "007",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_chat_lv2_001",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "917222": {
    "Id": 917222,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "我这里不安排住院，治完了就自觉离开吧。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "004",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_chat_lv2_002",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "917223": {
    "Id": 917223,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "再往上走，可能会没命……不过，这和我有什么关系？",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "012",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_chat_lv2_003",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "917224": {
    "Id": 917224,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "素质不错，看来还能撑个几轮。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "008",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_chat_lv2_004",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "917225": {
    "Id": 917225,
    "Name": "贝缇丽",
    "Content": "我这里不提供其他服务。",
    "Color": "#95c1f9",
    "Face": "011",
    "Voice": "vo_npc172_chat_lv2_005",
    "NPCId": 9172,
    "Affinity": [
      2700,
      10699
    ]
  },
  "917226": {
